==English==

===Etymology===
{{compound|en|check|sum}}

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|mathematics|computing}} A number, derived by applying a suitable [[algorithm]] to some [[data]], used to [[check]] whether [[error]]s have occurred in [[transmission]], [[storage]] or [[data entry]].

